        "We propose adding support for profile-guided optimization (PGO) to the Go gc toolchain.",
        "PGO will enable the toolchain to perform application- and workload-specific optimizations based on run-time information.",
        "Unlike many compiler optimizations, PGO requires user involvement to collect profiles and feed them back into the build process.",
        "Hence, we propose a design that centers user experience and ease of deployment and fits naturally into the broader Go build ecosystem."
